":true,"available":true,"citationId":"g2gecij1185b3pm45cq5m2kd0"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":"l2yjdo4dc0y7w5867i97qt829","title":"源杰科技获17.44亿元大额订单 激光器芯片业务成业绩增长核心","summary":"源杰科技公告称获B客户大额激光器芯片订单，金额达17.44亿元人民币。公司前三季度营收同比增长319.83%，净利润增长866.88%，主要依赖数据中心光模块产品出货。华鑫证券指出800G光模块已进入规模部署，1.6T产品2026年商用，公司产能扩张计划预计2027年形成产能，2028年产能进一步释放。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202611133930876693.html","publishedAt":"2026-11-13T12:03:56.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Payward第三季度调整后EBITDA同比下降67%，披露代币化股票与链上永续合约计划","summary":"Payward第三季度调整后EBITDA为6000万美元，同比下降67%；总平台利润4.87亿美元，同比下降12%；交易量3530亿美元，同比下降30%，但余额账户数同比增长37%至710万。公司披露将拓展代币化股票业务，计划在美国上线链上永续合约（需监管批准），并已同意收购Saldo Bank。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1d500-5ea4-7113-b827-899d72d22151","publishedAt":"2026-11-13T13:02:13.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"ofvlq7zh5kh6hvbsotvx5rsq9"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.